.TH DCC-KBD-CLI 1 2026-11-22 "Dudes Control Center @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.nh
.SH NAME
dcc-kbd-cli \- control the keyboard backlight
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dcc-kbd-cli
.RI [ option ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dcc-kbd-cli
talks to
.BR dcc-kbd-daemon (8)
over
.IR /run/dcc-kbd.sock .
The user must be root or a member of the group
.BR dudes-control-center .
Without options it shows whether the backlight is on, the brightness, the
number of LEDs and the active profile.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-on
Switch the backlight on with the active profile.
.TP
.B \-\-off
Switch the backlight off; it stays off after a reboot until switched on.
.TP
.BI \-\-brightness " level"
Set the hardware brightness, from 0 to the maximum (usually 10).
.TP
.BI \-\-color " color"
Light the whole keyboard in one color without changing any profile.
.I color
is
.IR R , G , B
(each 0\-255),
.BI # RRGGBB
or one of
.BR white ", " red ", " green ", " blue ", " yellow ", " cyan ", "
.BR magenta ", " orange ", " purple .
The active profile returns with
.B \-\-profile
or after a restart of the daemon.
.TP
.B \-\-list\-profiles
List the keyboard profiles; the active one is marked with
.BR * .
.TP
.BI \-\-profile " name"
Activate a keyboard profile.
.TP
.BI \-\-show\-profile " name"
Show the base color and the zones of a profile.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show a short help.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 on an error (daemon not reachable, unknown profile, invalid
value).
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B dcc-kbd-cli \-\-brightness 5
Half brightness.
.TP
.B dcc-kbd-cli \-\-color 0,128,255
Whole keyboard light blue.
.TP
.B dcc-kbd-cli \-\-profile """Gaming"""
Activate the profile Gaming.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dudes-control-center (7),
.BR dcc-kbd-daemon (8),
.BR dcc-gui (1)
